{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07801","headline":"与杭州薛司户登樟亭楼作 · 孟浩然","name":"与杭州薛司户登樟亭楼作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"水楼一登眺，半出青林高。\n帟幕英僚敞，芳筵下客叨。\n山藏伯禹穴，城压伍胥涛。\n今日观溟涨，垂纶学钓鳌。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟浩然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07801.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07801","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}